\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {SAC-generated Container Task Morphology.} The SAC-generated morphology is shown with a trajectory in the container task. The morphology is simple with 2 links, one z-hinge that's 0.1179m and one y-hinge that's 0.5151m. The manipulator is not quite long enough to reach the start position and significantly off the orientation, but appears right on the goal pose. }}{19}{}\protected@file@percent }
